<section aria-labelledby="<%= guideline_anchor(:options) %>">
  <h2 id="<%= guideline_anchor(:options) %>">5. Options</h2>
  <p>
    Options are the choices that a buyer has when they buy the product, for example the length of
    a cable or the colour of a product. Options never change the specifications
    (see <a href="#<%= guideline_anchor(:product_or_version) %>">3.1</a>).
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Add each possible combination as one option. For a cable in two lengths and two colours:
      <i>1 m / black</i>, <i>2 m / black</i>, <i>1 m / red</i>, <i>2 m / red</i>.
    </li>
    <li>If the brand uses a different model number for each option, add it to the option.</li>
  </ul>
</section>
